{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Vanessa Works the Evening Shift", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "An Unwanted Phone Call", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 3, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 6, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Exchange advice and suggestions in communicative situations. ", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Phrasal Verbs about Phone Communication", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " A phrasal verb is a phrase formed with a verb + preposition. Some phrasal verbs are unique to communication on the phone. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": " Look at the following list of phrasal verbs. Try to use some of these the next time you're on the phone.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":13,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Phrasal Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to call up/ring up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to call and  try to reach someone on the phone\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to get through\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to succeed in speaking to someone on the telephone\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to set up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to arrange another call or video chat\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to hang on\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to wait for a short time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to hold on\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to wait for a short time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to put through\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to connect a caller to someone in the office\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to pick up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to answer a phone call\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to speak up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to speak louder into the phone\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to hang up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to end a conversation and disconnect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to cut off\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to interrupt a phone conversation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to call back\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to call someone again or in return\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to break up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" when the other person's voice is unclear and you can't hear them well\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Can you please put me through to the manager?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Can you please speak up? I can't hear you well.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "When is the best time to call back?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I hate salespeople who ring up like that.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Could we set up a video chat later?", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Changing Topics on the Phone", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You can use expressions to redirect a phone conversation when it is not the right time to continue or it's not someone you wish to talk to.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "To let the caller know that today is not a good time for a phone conversation, you use:<br/><span class=\"italic\">Oh, this isn't really a good day.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "To let the caller know that you're very busy at the moment, you use:<br/><span class=\"italic\">I'm sorry ... I'm pretty tied up right now.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "To let the caller know that perhaps another time later would be better, you use:<br/><span class=\"italic\">Maybe another time.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "To let the person know that there is something they might be interested in, you use:<br/><span class=\"italic\">Actually, we're running a special discount campaign right now. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "To let the caller know that it isn't possible to talk right now, you use:<br/><span class=\"italic\">I really can't speak to you right now. We're terribly busy. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "To apologize that you must end the conversation, you use:<br/><span class=\"italic\">I'm sorry. I must go.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "To thank the caller quickly for the information and then end the phone call, you use:<br/><span class=\"italic\">Thanks so much. I've got to go.</span>", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to demonstrate", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to physically show how something is done", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I was wondering if I could demonstrate our new kitchen equipment to you. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about work over the phone.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "tied up ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " busy; occupied", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm pretty tied up right now, so maybe another time. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "terribly", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very to a stressful point", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We're terribly busy. I'm sorry, but I must go.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to break up", "type": "name"}, {"content": "when the other person's voice on the phone is unclear", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Actually, you're breaking up. I can hardly hear you.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to call up", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to try to reach someone on the phone", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'll call up again early next week.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to look through ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to take a look; to have a preview", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If we set up a video chat, you can look through our showroom live.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Imagine you get an unwanted call from a salesperson.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a dialogue on what they're trying to present to you.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use expressions to change the topic.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 8 - 10 lines.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice your dialogue with your partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write a dialogue for an unwanted phone call.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use proper phrases to change topics on the phone.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use appropriate intonation and rhythm for a phone conversation.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn7le06ob03re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le06ob03re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hello, Bistro 88, Vanessa speaking.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Salesperson</span>: Hi. This is Jenny from Acme Restaurant Equipment Services. Can you please put me through to the manager?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I am the manager. How can I help you?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Salesperson</span>: Oh, we have some new models of kitchen equipment that you'd be excited about. I was wondering if I could demonstrate them to you.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh, this isn't really a good day. I'm pretty tied up right now. Maybe another time. We're doing fine with our kitch ..."}, {"image": "engenn7le06ob03re2img05.jpg", "time": "32390", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Salesperson</span>: Actually, we're running a special discount campaign right now. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm sure it's all very exciting, but I really can't speak to you right now. We're terribly busy. I'm sorry. I must go.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Salesperson</span>: No problem. I understand. When's the best time to call back?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well ... <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Salesperson</span>: Why don't you check out our website? And then we could set up a video chat. Then you can look through our showroom live."}, {"image": "engenn7le06ob03re2img01.jpg", "time": "54700", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Actually, you're breaking up \u2026 <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Salesperson</span>: It's www. acme kitchen e q . com<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Super. Thanks so much. I've got to go.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Salesperson</span>: Sure. I'll call up early next week. Thank you. Bye.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I hate salespeople who ring up like that."}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le06ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le06ob03re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about jobs and work. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can manage a phone conversation. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can change topics.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Have you ever had an unwanted phone call?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " How did you manage the conversation?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What did you say to redirect or end the phone call?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " What do you say when you get an unwanted call?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "\nVanessa gets an unwanted phone call at work.\n", "type": "text"}, {"content": " ", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]